<div class="home-page-feature">
    <img src="/assets/placeholder-unsplash.jpg">
</div>
<div>Simple Supply Co. is where the creatively curious come to play. We're a supply shop for makers, dreamers, and even you doodlers out there — stocking everything from premium paints and drawing materials to the kind of stationery that makes you actually want to write things down. Quality pens that feel just right, sketchbooks begging to be filled, planners that might actually help you get organized, and those delightful little oddities that make you go "ooh, that's nice…"</div>
<div>Featured Collection</div>
{% include 'featured-collection' %}


<div>Featured Product</div>
{% include 'featured-product' %}


<div>Categories</div>
{% for collection in collections %}
  {% unless collection.metafields.custom.parent_collection %}
    {{ collection.title | link_to: collection.url }}
  {% endunless %}
{% endfor %}
{% stylesheet %}
.home-page-feature {
    background-color: #f5f5f5;
    width: 90%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    margin: 0px auto 0px auto;
    max-width: 1240px;

}
.home-page-feature img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    z-index: 1;
    position: relative;
}
{% endstylesheet %}
